---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/jobs';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`Privacy policy detailing data minimization, server logs, and third-party advertising disclosures for ${SITE_NAME}.`}
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy"
>
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-ink-secondary">
    <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent hover:underline">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
      <li aria-current="page" class="text-ink font-medium">Privacy Policy</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-3xl bg-surface border border-border-strong rounded-[3px] p-5 sm:p-7 space-y-5">
    <header class="border-b border-border pb-4 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-secondary">Effective Date: 25 Nov 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE_NAME} does not require user registration, does not provide candidate
        application forms, and does not collect sensitive personal data such as
        government ID numbers, bank details, academic transcripts, or resumes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">2. Standard Access Logs</h2>
      <p>
        Our static hosting provider may record standard HTTP request metadata (such as
        anonymized IP address, requested URL, browser user-agent, and timestamp) solely
        for security, abuse prevention, and aggregate uptime monitoring.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">
        3. Advertising &amp; Third-Party Cookies
      </h2>
      <p>
        When advertising slots are enabled, third-party ad networks (such as Google
        AdSense) may use cookies or local storage signals to deliver contextual or
        interest-based advertisements in accordance with applicable privacy regulations.
        You may manage ad personalization preferences directly via your browser or ad
        network settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-ink leading-[1.6]">
      <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">4. External Official Links</h2>
      <p>
        Clicking an &ldquo;Apply Online&rdquo; or &ldquo;Download Official PDF&rdquo;
        link transfers you to external government or institutional portals governed by
        their own respective privacy policies.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
